From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:38:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(blocks): render textured Bedrock full cubes

Bedrock custom block states previously all used the coarse-dirt fallback. Convert terrain atlas textures into distinct Java note-block models and assign those states only to opaque full cubes with one material and no visual permutations. This preserves the normal fallback for geometry and materials the converter cannot represent, and invalidates cached packs so existing downloads receive the new models.
